{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Marbles is a comfy game about building marble runs on a sunny afternoon. Using a huge range of bits and pieces, fit together the marble course you\u2019ve always wanted to build and play with. Unwind to a lo-fi ASMR soundscape and roll with the nostalgia.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/0a3f4ac6f6182bb8078ef779092d60bb.poster.avif?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/0a3f4ac6f6182bb8078ef779092d60bb.webm?t=1769160499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/255ead7dcf58d5afe224058014aeb78c.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with freeform construction tools and a rich library of parts. Design awesome loops, twists and drops, then roll your marbles off on their adventure. Take \u201cplaying with marbles\u201d to a whole new level by guiding them across complex courses, bouncing them over obstacles with boosters and ramps, and even shooting them from cannons. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/c44138996b865506290ef183997526b4.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your marble run from wood, metal or plastic, choose its colors and give it a name. Customize your cosy marbles with a range of colors, facial expressions, stylish hats and silly little arms that flail while rolling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/4b32c81c24d4dcabe1d99bf569e6fc9f.poster.avif?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/4b32c81c24d4dcabe1d99bf569e6fc9f.webm?t=1769160499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/1092d1988ba9734bf8a86c9c4185f2b3.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Marbles is a little game with a big brain. Plan and experiment with all sorts of marble constructs, from marble rollercoasters to wacky apparatus. Watch your marbles flow through carefully laid routes\u2026 or fly way off track! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/555712954d8991deb14a675bd43d4d58.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a marble course, place its finish line, and drop your marbles to watch them race to the end. May the best marble win. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/7c73414f6cd4a3c41badcd56f519518b.poster.avif?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/7c73414f6cd4a3c41badcd56f519518b.webm?t=1769160499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/3917b4c6a5473affacd96e4b7f55ed5c.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best next step after perfecting your marble masterpiece (or grotesque marble trap) is to share it with the world. Export and import courses to show off your build and try everyone else\u2019s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>We think you'll love Cozy Marbles if you enjoy...</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Marbles on Stream, Marble World, Tiny Glade, Satisfactory, House Flipper 2, Small Spaces,  PowerWash Simulator 2, Islands &amp; Trains, Tiny Book Shop, Supermarket Simulator, Sticky Business, A Little To The Left, Rollercoaster Tycoon.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836460?t=1769160499","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/21a85bc57b41e2e9baa120a9f299de6cea6ed8de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769160499","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/29d4f05204d7b5f779fc6d63f70c38d57a6e5c48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769160499","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/29d4f05204d7b5f779fc6d63f70c38d57a6e5c48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769160499","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/5f6b8e163beb96914d4bc534e63d18e7.avif?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=124 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Marbles is a comfy game about building marble runs on a sunny afternoon. Using a huge range of bits and pieces, fit together the marble course you\u2019ve always wanted to build and play with. Unwind to a lo-fi ASMR soundscape and roll with the nostalgia.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/0a3f4ac6f6182bb8078ef779092d60bb.poster.avif?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/0a3f4ac6f6182bb8078ef779092d60bb.webm?t=1769160499\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/255ead7dcf58d5afe224058014aeb78c.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker with freeform construction tools and a rich library of parts. Design awesome loops, twists and drops, then roll your marbles off on their adventure. Take \u201cplaying with marbles\u201d to a whole new level by guiding them across complex courses, bouncing them over obstacles with boosters and ramps, and even shooting them from cannons. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836460/extras/c44138996b865506290ef183997526b4.webp?t=1769160499\" width=780 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your marble run from wood, metal or plastic, choose its colors and give it a name. Customize your cosy marbles with a range of colors, facial expressions, stylish hats and silly little arms that flail while rolling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au